This is a modified, unofficial distribution of the Omnigent VS Code extension
(https://github.com/omnigent-ai/omnigent, editors/vscode), maintained at
https://github.com/IceRhymers/omnigent-ide-extensions. It is not made, reviewed
or supported by Databricks or the Omnigent team.

Changes from the upstream source: the extension's name, publisher and
repository metadata; its packaging and build scripts; its README, CHANGELOG and
this NOTICE; two helper modules copied into src/vendor/omnigent/ from the
Omnigent desktop app (web/electron/src/) and the imports that load them; and
formatting. PROVENANCE.md in the repository records the source commits and
every changed file.

